# dtx-scan staging. The cloud pipeline (no systematic-tss, no network) READS committed staging;
# a systematic-tss+network host (dev nightly / ser) refreshes + commits it BEFORE the 23h routine.
#
# dtx MCP catalogue cut-over (2026-08-12): `best` is the SOLE portfolio of the catalogue — it
# aggregates and replaces the six legacy books (book_honest, ep, etf_us, hvep, stockbox_pit,
# us_highvol), which were removed on 2026-08-13 (superseded, unreferenced by DTX_STAGING_MAP /
# dtx-pool-bridge). Only `best` is wired and versioned; everything else (legacy books, unwired
# portfolios, machine-local engine state) stays ignored — regenerable byproducts.
*.json
state/
# best — seul portefeuille du catalogue depuis le 2026-08-12. Sans cette
# exception, le staging n'est pas versionné : la routine cloud ne le voit pas,
# le pont est sauté et le panneau du mode ressort VIDE.
!best.json
